inst/element-ui/ contains an unmodified copy of Element UI 2.15.14
(index.js, its locales, theme-chalk/index.css and display.css, and the
element-icons fonts), bundled so the
package works without fetching anything at runtime.

inst/element-ui/theme-chalk-src.tar.gz contains Element UI 2.15.14's theme
Sass sources (packages/theme-chalk/src, without the fonts), from which a themed
stylesheet is compiled. Two mixins in mixins/mixins.scss, m() and e(), are
rewritten to build their selector lists without a trailing comma, which
crashes the libsass the sass package uses; the selectors they produce are
the same. Otherwise the files are unmodified.

